{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1195454-practical-and-potential-maxima-for-attributes","id":1195454,"title":"Practical and potential maxima for attributes","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum"],"posts":[{"date":"2018-03-14T13:44:47-07:00","id":1195454,"title":"Practical and potential maxima for attributes","content":"The Bio and Vita Kinetic aptitudes mention these multiple times and reference to the Core. In the Core it's stated they are set by your character Tier, but then there is never a chart of the tiers for anything other than difficulties. then we have the edge superior trait which the potential for a trait to one above your practical limt<br /> <br /> Where is this defined?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5118-perverseness","name":"Perverseness","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"57"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-14T14:15:44-07:00","id":1195463,"title":"","content":"When this same question was asked over on RPG.net, this was my answer:<br /> &quot;Core Rules Preview, pg 66 <b>Superior Trait</b>: &quot;Your character has some combination of innate ability and special training that allows him to exceed the <i>Practical limit</i> on one Attribute and raise it above the normal maximum potential.&quot; Judging by this, &quot;Practical Maximum&quot; is 5 (6 if Proxy Tier) +1 if you have Superior Trait for that Attribute. &quot;Potential Maximum +1&quot; is 7 (8 if Proxy), superior trait is already factored into the Potential Maximum.&quot;<br /> <br /> To which John Snead replied: &quot;That's correct&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/258-thesarcasticsage","name":"TheSarcasticSage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-14T14:36:59-07:00","id":1195472,"title":"","content":"I think that a chart would be great to list potential and practical and such attribute ratings. <br /> <br /> Honestly the whole Tier trait seems like a better chart system would help. I'm looking at those of say WoD/CoD games as they aid in easy learning the max ratings allowed at various dot ratings.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-14T15:00:18-07:00","id":1195483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LordHeru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/1195454-practical-and-potential-maxima-for-attributes?p=1195472#post1195472\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think that a chart would be great to list potential and practical and such attribute ratings.<br /> <br /> Honestly the whole Tier trait seems like a better chart system would help. I'm looking at those of say WoD/CoD games as they aid in easy learning the max ratings allowed at various dot ratings.</div> </div> </div> </div>There is no need for a chart when it can be said in 2 sentences... &quot;Practical Maximum is 5 (6 if Proxy Tier) +1 if you have Superior Trait for that Attribute. Potential Maximum +1 is 7 (8 if Proxy), superior trait is already factored into the Potential Maximum.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/258-thesarcasticsage","name":"TheSarcasticSage","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar258_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-14T15:03:25-07:00","id":1195487,"title":"","content":"Right. But the thing is as of this moment in the file we have, I'm pretty sure its not stated that way. Hence the various questions madw about it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/661-lordheru","name":"LordHeru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar661_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2018-03-14T17:02:37-07:00","id":1195529,"title":"","content":"There's a reference to a section that's supposed to talk about the Tiers and the benefits they provide. That section does not exist in the current manuscript.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}